<file path="context.md">
 1: # Project Architecture & Context — 3D Prelaunch Showcase Website
 2: 
 3: ## Project Purpose
 4: High-impact, immersive 3D prelaunch showcase website for an upcoming event ("Saskaran / Deck of Cards 2026"). The site features interactive 3D WebGL scenes, smooth page transitions, interactive canvas shaders, particle systems, dynamic countdown, and waitlist/prelaunch registration UI.
 5: 
 6: ## Architecture
 7: - **Framework**: Next.js 16 (React 19) App Router
 8: - **3D & Graphics Engine**: Three.js, WebGL shaders, PerspectiveCamera, PBR lighting, custom particle nebula (`/threejs-webgl`)
 9: - **Animation Suite**: GSAP, Motion / Framer Motion
10: - **UI & Design System**: Tailwind CSS v4, Radix UI primitives, shadcn/ui components, Aceternity UI effects (`/design`, `/design-system`)
11: - **Fast Discovery & Memory Architecture**:
12:   - `/repomix`: Full repository context packed into [repomix-output.xml](file:///f:/C++/codes/Hackathons/Saskaran%20deck%20of%20cards%202026%20static%20site/repomix-output.xml).
13:   - `/serena`: O(1) symbol lookup and semantic keyword indexing in `.serena/symbols.json` via `node scripts/serena-lookup.mjs <query>`.
14:   - `/agentmemory`: Persistent episodic and domain invariant vector/KV store in `.agentmemory/memory.json` via `node scripts/agentmemory.mjs query <term>`.
15: - **Type Safety**: TypeScript strict mode
16: - **Deployment & Hosting Strategy**: Static export ready (`output: 'export'`) or Vercel / Netlify edge deployment for zero-cold-start landing performance.
17: 
18: ## Key Directories
19: - `src/app`: App Router pages, layout, and global CSS tokens.
20: - `src/components/3d`: Three.js WebGL canvas scenes, particle systems, camera rigs, and interactive 3D elements.
21: - `src/components/ui`: Reusable UI primitives (shadcn/ui + Radix UI + Aceternity UI components).
22: - `src/components/event`: Event-specific showcase sections (hero, countdown, cards/lore, schedule, pre-registration).
23: - `src/lib`: Utility functions (`cn` helper, event constants, 3D math helpers).
24: - `scripts/`: Tooling for repomix, serena semantic symbol indexing, and agentmemory queries.
25: - `.serena/`: O(1) codebase symbols index (`symbols.json`).
26: - `.agentmemory/`: Domain invariants, component contracts, and debugging history (`memory.json`).
27: 
28: ## Core Invariants
29: 1. **WebGL SSR Boundary**: All 3D canvas modules must be loaded with dynamic import `{ ssr: false }`.
30: 2. **GPU Memory Disposal**: Every geometry, material, texture, and WebGLRenderer must be explicitly disposed on unmount.
31: 3. **DPR Cap**: Maximum device pixel ratio capped at 2 (`Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2)`).
32: 4. **Three-Layer Tokens**: CSS custom properties organized into Primitive -> Semantic -> Component variables.
</file>

