  1: # Features Implemented
  2: 
  3: ## Current Status Overview
  4: All foundational libraries, 3D WebGL scenes, UI components, O(1) discovery engines, and the full interactive **3D Shuffle to Monolith Corridor HeroSection with Entrance Deal and Warp Surge** have been built and verified.
  5: 
  6: ### 1. Monolith Corridor & Multi-Formation Cardistry Hero (`/react-three-fiber`, `/gsap-animation`, `/threejs-webgl`, `/design-taste-frontend`, `/taste-skill`)
  7: - **Status**: Implemented
  8: - **Description**: Recreated from the user's reference media and cardistry choreography specifications:
  9:   - **Hero Re-Entry Animation Loop Auto-Revival**: Scrolling back to the top of the page (or clicking Back to Top / `#hero`) immediately revives and smoothly restarts the continuous 5-stage cardistry animation loop, transitioning seamlessly back into Formation 0 (3D Shuffle) or replaying the opening sequence.
 10:   - **Continuous Looping 5-Stage 3D Cardistry Formations**:
 11:     1. **Formation 0: 3D Riffle Helix Shuffle**: Interlocking dual-helix cascade fanning and weaving with dynamic harmonic waves and kinetic spread bursts.
 12:     2. **Formation 1: Monolith Corridor**: Infinite two-column avenue sentinels extending into the deep fog with interactive click-to-surge warp plunge.
